          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">For Providers &amp; Professional Partners</span>
            <h1>Referring a patient? <em>Start here.</em></h1>
            <p class="lead">Everything your office needs to send someone to Therapy by David: who I help, insurance, availability, and how the handoff works.</p>
          </div>
