    <!-- HOW TO REFER -->
    <section class="section" style="background: var(--cream); padding-bottom: 56px;">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">How to Refer</span>
        <h2>Three ways, all simple.</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin: 36px 0 36px;">
          <div class="reveal" style="background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(20,33,50,.08); border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(20,33,50,.09); padding: 28px;">
            <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--night);color:var(--champagne);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;">1</div>
            <p style="font-size: 15px;">Give the client my number or email, or point them to this page.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal" style="background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(20,33,50,.08); border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(20,33,50,.09); padding: 28px;">
            <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--night);color:var(--champagne);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;">2</div>
            <p style="font-size: 15px;">Or have your office contact me directly with the client's name and number (with their consent). I follow up within one business day.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal" style="background: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(20,33,50,.08); border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(20,33,50,.09); padding: 28px;">
            <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--night);color:var(--champagne);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;">3</div>
            <p style="font-size: 15px;">Every referred client starts with a <strong style="color: var(--night);">free 15-minute phone consultation</strong>. If I'm not the right fit, I'll say so and help them find someone who is.</p>
