        </div>
        <div class="reveal refer-expect-grid">
          <p style="font-size: 15px; margin: 0;"><strong style="color: var(--night);">What referred clients can expect:</strong> structured, practical work, usually weekly, grounded in evidence-based practice. We name the pattern keeping the anxiety, stress, or conflict alive, build the skills to regulate it, and practice responding differently. Clients know what we're working on and why, from the first session.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-dark" style="align-self: start; white-space: nowrap;" href="/assets/therapy-by-david-referral-sheet.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the referral sheet (PDF)</a>
        </div>
      </div>
